# Cheerful builder who loves chaining searches and spending resources.
name: Tink
title: the Tinkerer
aggression: 0.55
caution: 0.35
patience: 0.4
spending: 0.8
skill: 0.8
decks: gadgets
intro: Red finds Green, Green finds Yellow... want to see the whole machine?
win: Clockwork! Everything clicked into place.
lose: Back to the workshop. Something's loose in there.
partner: Partners! Two toolboxes. I'll hand you parts, you build something loud.
look: Young inventor in a tool belt and oversized goggles, with red, green and yellow wind-up robots peeking from her pockets.
ladder: 4   # campaign order (1 = first opponent)
signature: Cyber Dragon   # the first-win gift and the bond 5 gift (CardUnlocks)
# Said during a duel: a big summon, hitting hard, taking a hit, falling to 1000 LP or less.
summon: Gears turning! Look at it go!
strike: Clockwork precision!
hit: Hey! That was a prototype!
danger: Just need one more part...
